OL,3,GNEWSAIsland could protect 30% of waters
OL,4,Ain marine plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FFreddie Watson, Channel Islands project
OL,7,Fmanager at Blue Marine Foundation, told
OL,8,FBBC Radio Guernsey that marine
OL,9,Fprotection could help safeguard
OL,10,Fsensitive habitats while supporting
OL,11,Fsustainable fishing.
OL,13,FThe proposal is expected to be
OL,14,Fsubmitted to the island's governing
OL,15,FChief Pleas by 1 September.
